		<description><![CDATA[Been quite a bit in the news on whistle-blowers (not the newly invented &#8216;leakers&#8217; a trigger word)  lately.  The NSA has been trashed by the Snowden leaks.  The CIA humiliated and damaged by the Wikileaks papers.  At one level this is journalism at it&#8217;s finest.  But if social sentiment turns to far against them this [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Why we need intelligence agencies" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/107" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
